+- **Registration.** `tests/fork-sources.txt` gains this report; `tests/upstream-modifications.txt` gains the
+  `include/RemotePluginBase.h` reason. The probe source was already registered
+  (`tests/fork-sources.txt:3362`).
+- **Committed files.** `include/RemotePluginBase.h`, `tests/src/core/RemotePluginShmFifoNoSysIpcProbe.cpp`,
+  `tests/fork-sources.txt`, `tests/upstream-modifications.txt`, this report.
+- **LOG FOLDER exception (reported, not hidden).** Every write to
+  `~/.local/share/zene-bunny-fix/qwen/runs/ci-4e020460347493c3.r1/logs/` is refused by the session's file
+  policy while the directory is `drwxr-xr-x kruzzzzy kruzzzzy`: `touch .../probe.log` -> `Permission denied`,
